  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMFREL Committee For Free And Fair elections In Cambodia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">COMFREL Committee For Free And Fair elections In Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering citizens to promote democracy and elections, 1 August 2022 &#x2013; 31 December 2023 Project location: All 25 provinces of Cambodia and Phnom Penh (country-wide)  The aim is to enable civil society actors and citizens (including women, young people and other marginalised groups) to enjoy democratic rights and freedoms, to increase the participation of citizens, in particular voters, women, young people and marginalised groups in the promotion of democracy and elections, and to produce recommendations and reports to improve democracy and elections.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Empowering citizens to promote democracy and elections, 1.8.2022-31.12.2023 Hankkeen sijainti: Kambodzhan kaikki 25 provinssia sek&#xe4; Phnom Penh (maanlaajuinen)  Tavoitteena on mahdollistaa kansalaiskunnan toimijoille ja kansalaisille, (ml. naiset, nuoret ja muut syrj&#xe4;ytyneet ryhm&#xe4;t) demokraattiset oikeudet ja vapaudet, lis&#xe4;t&#xe4; kansalaisten, erityisesti &#xe4;&#xe4;nioikeudellisten henkil&#xf6;iden, naisten, nuorten ja syrj&#xe4;ytyneiden ryhmien osallistumista demokratian ja vaalien edist&#xe4;miseen, sek&#xe4; tuottaa suosituksia ja raportteja demokratian ja vaalien parantamiseksi.</narrative>
  </description>
